<div align="center">

# 🚀 SnapFix AI

### AI-Powered Civic Issue Reporting & Municipal Operations Platform

Transforming civic issue reporting through **Computer Vision**, **Geospatial Intelligence**, and **Modern Full-Stack Engineering**.

---

